# Bloody student ghost (pi-tusungi wongwi): a schoolgirl soaked in blood from
# the scalp down, long hair hanging over her face, one red eye, leaving drops
# as she drags herself forward. Side view, faces right, 24x32.
# GORE SET (optional): hidden when the "gore" option is off; see docs/decisions.md D9.
